{
  "name": "AI lead qualifier",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI lead qualifier\n1. Website form posts to the webhook\n2. Lead is cleaned and validated\n3. Gemini scores it against **your** ideal-client profile\n4. **Hot** \u2192 Slack alert + Gmail draft reply, ready to send\n5. Every lead lands in Google Sheets with score and reasons\n6. If the AI is down, the lead is still logged for manual review\n\n**Edit the Config node** to set your company profile and score thresholds.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ffbb3ad8-ec01-5122-9f0e-2268b304a500",
      "name": "Note: overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setup\n- Credential **Gemini API key** (Header Auth): name `x-goog-api-key`, value = key from aistudio.google.com/apikey\n- Connect Slack, Gmail and Google Sheets\n- Sheet tab `Leads` with the columns from *Sheet row*\n- Activate, then point your form at the production webhook URL",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "65d7fe73-3955-505d-bde2-882df7f1b75e",
